{%- comment -%}
  OFD7 — GLP-1 Off-Ramp advertorial/protocol hybrid.
  Audience: People tapering off GLP-1 injections, side-effect refugees, can't-take-shots.
  Reframe: shots cover 1 of 3 areas. WLP-1 covers all three.
  Compliance: structure/function only, "GLP-1 injections" never brand names, ~ on weight numbers.
  Buybox: native form POST /cart/add, return_to=/checkout. Default 3-mo sub.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
